  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(3x - 10)% of 150 exceeds x% of 300 by 15\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nAccording to the question,\n\n[(3x - 10)% of 150] - [x% of 300] = 15\n\n⇒ 4.5x - 15 - 3x = 15\n\n⇒ 4.5x - 3x = 15 + 15\n\n⇒ 1.5x = 30\n\n⇒ x = 30/1.5 = 20\n\nNow,\n\n(2 × 20 + 5)% of 220 = 220 × (45/100)\n\n⇒ 99\n\n(20 + 10)% of 250 = 250 × (30/100)\n\n⇒ 75\n\nDifference = 99 - 75\n\n⇒ 24\n\nRequired % = (24/75) × 100\n\n⇒ 32\n\n**∴ Required answer is 32%.**",
